    {
      "lore": "There are many ways by which to deploy troops to the field of battle including tunnels, teleportation devices and other esoteric means of transportation.",
      "name": "Deep Strike",
      "rules": "Each time this unit makes an <b>ingress move</b> (20.04), if every model in this unit has this ability, it can be set up anywhere on the battlefield that is more than 8\" horizontally from all enemy units, even if that is within your opponent’s deployment zone.",
      "isAura": false,
      "isPain": false,
      "isPsychic": false,
      "isBondsman": false,
      "abilityType": "core",
      "restriction": null,
      "displayOrder": 0,
      "subAbilities": [],
      "subAbilityHeader": null
    },
    {
      "lore": null,
      "name": "Teleport Homer (Once per battle, per unit)",
      "rules": "At the start of the battle, you can set up one Teleport Homer token for this unit on the battlefield. If you do:\\r<ul><li>When you target this unit with the <b>Rapid Ingress stratagem</b>, you can use that Teleport Homer token. If you do, that use is -1 CP, but when resolving that <b>stratagem</b>, this unit must be set up within 3\" of that Teleport Homer token and not within 8\" of an enemy unit. That Teleport Homer token is then removed from the battlefield. </li>\\r<li>If an enemy unit ends a move within 1\" of that Teleport Homer token, that Teleport Homer token is removed from the battlefield.</li></ul>",
      "isAura": false,
      "isPain": false,
      "isPsychic": false,
      "isBondsman": false,
